 "literal": "Having intense desire for embrace, having desirable beauty, / having rounded soft breasts, having creeper-like tresses, / how can I forget and remain still? I indeed, there, / like a shivering-headed calf of a good cow with abundant milk-flow, / with the desire to see its mother, / she of dark beauty looked with a languishing gaze.",
